Crystallographic structures — atomipy/structures/ (minerals, crystals, …)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived from open crystallographic databases (e.g. the Crystallography Open
Database (COD) and the American Mineralogist Crystal Structure Database
(AMCSD)). Their original terms and attribution apply. When using a specific
structure, cite its original publication / database entry.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Force-field parameters — atomipy/ffparams/min.ff/
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MINFF force field (https://github.com/mholmboe/minff) and the CLAYFF
parameters are compiled from the published literature. Cite the original papers
referenced in the force-field files when using these parameters, including:
  - MINFF: see https://github.com/mholmboe/minff
  - CLAYFF: Cygan, Liang & Kalinichev, J. Phys. Chem. B 2004, 108, 1255.
